  Title: Scientists discovered a survival switch inside brain cells
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260127010138.htm
  category: research
  importance: 65
  ai_summary: "This article details a fascinating discovery about how brain cells can be protected during injury through internal metabolic mechanisms. This finding has significant implications for understanding and potentially treating neurodegenerative conditions."
  
